            <sparkle:version>278</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.15.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>Claude: Keel no longer offers a new version before Claude&#x27;s own updater has offered it to your Mac. Anthropic hands each version out in stages; until it&#x27;s your Mac&#x27;s turn the row reads &quot;Claude updates itself · 7.37095.0 out, not yet offered to this Mac&quot;, isn&#x27;t counted and isn&#x27;t in Update All. Once Claude has downloaded it, the row says &quot;ready: restart Claude to install&quot; with Restart Claude. To install it now anyway, use Update Anyway in the row&#x27;s ⋯ menu.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
